  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "*2 Beach Chairs & an Umbrella included during 2026 season!! (March-October)**<br><br>Welcome to Aquamarine, a stunning 4-bedroom, 4.5-bathroom retreat located in The Preserve at Grayton Beach. This spacious home sleeps 12 and is perfect for large families or groups seeking comfort, style, and convenience near the beach. <br><br>Three luxurious bedrooms each feature a king bed, while the fourth bedroom offers a custom bunk bed with two twins over a queen—ideal for kids or extra guests. A sleeper sofa in the living area provides additional sleeping space. <br><br>The open-concept living and dining areas are perfect for relaxing or entertaining, and the fully equipped kitchen makes meal prep a breeze. Enjoy access to The Preserve’s two community pools, tennis courts, fitness room, and private beach access just a short stroll away. <br><br>Whether you're lounging in the beautifully furnished interior or exploring the best of 30A, Aquamarine is your perfect coastal getaway. <br><br>Included in the 2026 rental season is complimentary use of the onsite 6-passenger golf cart!<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (SLEEPS 12)<br>• Bedroom 1: 1 King Bed<br>• Bedroom 2: 1 King Bed<br>• Bedroom 3: 1 King Bed<br>• Bedroom 4: 1 Bunk Bed (2 Twin Beds over 1 Queen Bed)<br>• Living Area: 1 Sleeper Sofa<br><br>PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS:<br>• Spacious 4 bedrooms, 5 bathrooms<br>• Just a short driving distance from the private beach access for The Preserve<br>• Quiet home, quiet subdivision<br>• Community is gated, offering the security that comes with it!<br>• Two community pools (The west pool is heated seasonally!)<br>• Plenty of parking for you and your family<br><br>Blue Swell Vacation Rentals is a boutique property management company that specializes in top-of-the-line, luxury beach rentals from PCB, 30A, and Destin. Our loyal guests come back year after year because of the exclusive homes and condos we offer as well as the excellent service we provide. Our keyless entry, premier linens with 300 thread count sheets, plush towels, and high-end starter supplies are just the beginning of the convenient amenities we provide for every guest. Most importantly, Blue Swell’s phone service allows our guests to experience the best vacation ever with less stress. It is always a SWELL day at the beach!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Aquamarine in The Preserve at Grayton - Included Golf Cart, Close to Pool!"
        }
      ],
